Z||000001||85Josh||05-13-2001||12:23 PM||||spideyfoot, that thing is nade of ceramic and hardened steel! You are going to need a carbide drill bit to do this. Try looking at glass drilling bits at your hardware store, or call an industrial supply house. Good luck.<P>------------------<BR>85 2M4(Lil' Bit)||||reg||1
